    {
      "key": "info",
      "name": "Info",
      "permissionProfile": "infoReadOnly",
      "channels": [
        {
          "key": "welcome",
          "name": "welcome",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "topic": "Welcome to SNEStorage. Learn what the community is about and how to get access.",
          "initialMessages": [
            {
              "pin": true,
              "content": "# Welcome to SNEStorage\nSNEStorage is a community for SNES hacking, homebrew, documentation, tools, graphics, music, and creator resources.\n\nAccess to the community is reserved for members with a confirmed SNEStorage account. Connect your Discord account at https://snestorage.dev/Community to join.\n\nPlease read #rules before participating."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "key": "rules",
          "name": "rules",
          "type": "TEXT",
          "permissionProfile": "rulesPublicReadOnly",
          "topic": "The community rules. Full policy: https://snestorage.dev/Rules",
          "initialMessages": [
            {
              "pin": true,
              "content": "# SNEStorage Community Rules\n\nRead these rules before participating. Access to community channels is reserved for members with a confirmed SNEStorage account. Connect your Discord account at https://snestorage.dev/Community.\n\n**1 — Respect others.** Harassment, bullying, threats, discrimination, or deliberately provoking other members will not be tolerated.\n\n**2 — Context matters.** No specific words are automatically banned, but language used to harass, threaten, insult, or target others is prohibited.\n\n**3 — No NSFW or disturbing content.** Do not post pornography, gore, shock content, or similar material.\n\n**4 — Use the appropriate channels.** Keep discussions, support requests, projects, and resources in their corresponding channels whenever possible.\n\n**5 — No spam.** Do not spam messages, images, emojis, mentions, links, advertisements, or repeated content.\n\n**6 — No political or religious debates.** This community is focused on SNES development, homebrew, hacking, tools, and preservation.\n\n**7 — Do not distribute commercial ROMs.** Share modifications as BPS or IPS patches. Original homebrew ROMs may be shared by their creators or with permission.\n\n**8 — Credit creators.** Do not claim someone else's work as your own. Obtain permission before redistributing or modifying their work when required.\n\n**9 — No malicious or deceptive content.** Malware, phishing, scams, misleading downloads, and unsafe links are prohibited.\n\n**10 — No impersonation or ban evasion.** Do not use alternate accounts to bypass moderation or help someone evade a restriction.\n\n**11 — Follow staff instructions.** If you disagree with a decision, discuss it privately and respectfully with staff.\n\n**12 — Follow Discord's rules.** All members must comply with Discord's Terms of Service and Community Guidelines.\n\nFull policy: https://snestorage.dev/Rules\n\n**Get access:** Link Discord at https://snestorage.dev/Profile/Edit, then press **Allow Access**."
            }
          ]
        },
